Package: jarvis-idle
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-lock (= @VERSION@), systemd
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ automatic screen lock
 Locks the screen with jarvis-lock after a period without input (default
 10 minutes), when the lid closes and before suspend.
